&lt;/div&gt;</jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E27530-000FujiokaTatsumaMember">(注)４</jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
